    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><img class=\" size-full wp-image-510 aligncenter\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/SNR-DENTON.jpg\" alt=\"SNR DENTON\" width=\"132\" height=\"132\" />Dentons in Muscat brings its clients the benefits of thirty years of experience in the Oman market.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Last year the firm advised HSBC on a merger of its Oman branch and clients include Bechtel, USG and Oman Refineries &amp; Petroleum industries. It was the depth of knowledge of lawyers at SNR Denton that persuaded the judging panel that the Corporate &amp; Commercial award for 2013 should go to this outstanding firm.</p>",
